      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PROOF OF PURCHASE (3) is the top pick on the strength of a fresh reset, a Mackay trial second and prior Class 1 exposure in NSW. Her 1000m record is plain and she has been away a long time, but this looks a winnable return if that trial has her forward enough. GIGI FILLE (6) brings the best recent win, having scored at Emerald on soft ground by just under two lengths, and barrier one gives her every chance to repeat despite coming back to a distance where she has not yet placed. EMERALD JOY (7) was within just under three lengths of GIGI FILLE last time and has one win and six placings at around this trip, so she profiles as a genuine place threat. SPEC OF SILVER (4) gets weight relief, has a strong 1000m body of work and was only beaten two lengths at Twin Hills, though her winless season keeps her more in the each-way bracket. EMINEN (2) coming off a maiden win at Emerald on a soft track and jockey Raul Silvera Olivera sticks, cannot be ruled out.",
